1
00:00:00,257 --> 00:00:02,427
(Sheldon:)Would you like to talk about it?

2
00:00:04,427 --> 00:00:07,667
(Leonard:)Penny proposed,
and I didn't say yes.

3
00:00:09,332 --> 00:00:14,972
(Sheldon:)-Why not?
-That's a good question.

4
00:00:17,541 --> 00:00:19,381
(Sheldon:)Does that mean the
relationship is over?

5
00:00:20,877 --> 00:00:22,447
(Penny:)I don't know.

6
00:00:23,713 --> 00:00:24,953
(Sheldon:)Why don't you ask her?

7
00:00:27,717 --> 00:00:31,027
(Leonard:)Because I'm afraid
to know the answer.

8
00:00:35,458 --> 00:00:39,238
Wel... I'm sorry.

9
00:00:41,898 --> 00:00:45,748
(Leonard:)That's it? You're not
gonna make some dumb joke

10
00:00:45,902 --> 00:00:47,712
(Leonard:)or some inappropriate comment?

11
00:00:47,871 --> 00:00:49,411
(Penny:)No.

12
00:00:50,540 --> 00:00:54,820
(Sheldon:)You're my friend, and... I'm sorry.

13
00:01:00,383 --> 00:01:03,423
(Leonard:)Did you just put
a "kick me" sign on my back?

14
00:01:09,225 --> 00:01:11,205
(Penny:)No.

15
00:01:11,361 --> 00:01:13,601
(Sheldon:)That wouldn't be funny at all.

16
00:01:26,509 --> 00:01:28,679
Star Wars audition, take ons.

17
00:01:29,879 --> 00:01:34,449
(Howard:)Starring Howard Joel Wolowitz,
real-life astronaut.

18
00:01:40,957 --> 00:01:42,957
(Howard:)Vader is here,

19
00:01:43,126 --> 00:01:45,796
(Howard:)now, on this moon.

20
00:01:45,962 --> 00:01:47,602
(Howard:)I felt his presence.

21
00:01:47,764 --> 00:01:50,974
(Howard:)He's come for me.
He can feel when I'm near--

22
00:01:51,134 --> 00:01:52,304
(Bernadette:)How many times
do I have to tell you

23
00:01:52,469 --> 00:01:55,249
(Bernadette:)to replace the toilet paper
when it's empty?!

24
00:01:56,406 --> 00:01:59,946
-I'm in the middle of something!
-So am I!

